{"id":"237b39811ec8c31c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/530_模态逻辑_KD_45.md","title":"530 模态逻辑 KD 45","display":"530_模态逻辑_KD_45","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对象语言的原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义派生记号</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span> 是满足以下闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{530}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{530}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{530}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{530}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{530}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,530}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{530},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,530}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{530}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{530}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,530}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{530},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,530}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{530}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{530}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{530}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{530})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{530}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{530}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{530}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{530}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{530}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{530}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{530}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{530}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{530}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{530}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{530}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{530}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{530}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}=\\{\\Diamond A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}=\\{\\Diamond A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则与必然化规则分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{530}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{530}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{530}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{530}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化只能作用于空依赖较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{530}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{530}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{530}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{530}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{530}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{530}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{530}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{530}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{530}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{530}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{530}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{530}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{530}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{530}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{530}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{530}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D+4+5\">\\(D+4+5\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530},\\quad \\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530},\\quad \\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{530},\\quad \\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{530},\\quad \\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{530}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>均包含在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{530}\\)</span> 中，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A\">\\(A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A\\)</span> 不是本条目的新增公理族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{KD45}_{530}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{530},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{530},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{530},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{530},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,530},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{530},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{530},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{530},\n\